{
  "abstract": "A Lean 4 formalization of fixed-exponent polylogarithmic descent for almost all shortcut Collatz orbits in ordinary natural density. For every exponent above an explicit entropy threshold, every clock coefficient above the drift threshold, every positive height allowance, and every exceptional exponent strictly below the explicit entropy margin, the theorem produces a density-one same-witness landing, logarithmic clock, orbit ceiling, and the corresponding quantitative power-logarithmic exceptional-count bound.",
